## How the scoring works

Each process is scored from {{ rubric.scale_min }} to {{ rubric.scale_max }} on {{ rubric.criteria | length }} criteria. Five point the same way, where a higher score means a better candidate. Implementation risk points the other way, so it is inverted before the weighted score is worked out. The inversion is done by the engine, not by the judge.

